Hello! We're happy to release a new patch to fix a few issues.

The fixes include:

[list]
[*] Adjusting the character's spline (stairs);
[*] Addition of ambient and enemy sounds;
[*] Improves the AI ​​of enemies;
[*] Checkpoint adjustments
[/list]

Thank you for playing Memories of Fireflies, we'll be working to keep improving your experience :)

We're very happy to release our first official update, with many improvements to the game experience!

The fixes include:

[list]
[*]Adjustments on the game collision and assets physics;
[*]Adjustments of the character spline;
[*]Closing and blocking passages or improper openings, improving the levels experience;
[*]Adjustment of textures and visual indications;
[*]Object positioning adjustment;
[*]Adjustment of stairs and platforms;
[*]Performance Adjustments;
[*]Levers animation adjustment;
[*]Usability adjustments;
[/list]

Thank you for playing Memories of Fireflies, we'll be working to keep improving your experience :)
